Package: ramp.demog
Title: Human demography for `ramp.xds` 
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: c(
      person("David L.", "Smith", email = "smitdave@uw.edu", role = c("aut","cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4367-3849"))
    )
Description: 
   Utilities and functions to set up the human component for models in **`ramp.xds`**. Functions are available to
   set up vital dynamics -- births and deaths -- and to configure aging and migration. 
